<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 11:11:53 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a804975a017f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;第十一季&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Season 11" height="2882" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/selah/6a804975a017f.jpg" width="3842"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://selah.some.pics"&gt;@selah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 11:11:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a8039dce50c9</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我有时会过于追求完美，这让我无法像自己期望的那样频繁画画。我正在努力通过多做快速速写来克服这一点。如果我总是对自己的作品那么苛刻，就不会进步。我相信通过足够的练习，我会变得更放松，不再那么担心结果。我只想享受画画的过程，不抱任何期待。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Pencil sketch of a hand oh textured white paper." height="2001" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6a8039dce50c9.jpg" width="1502"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 10:05:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a80376c67ff1</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A badge.les.bi 生成的骄傲旗帜徽章，结合了跨性别旗帜与 genderfae 旗帜。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A badge.les.bi generated pride flag badge combining the trans flag with the genderfae flag." height="31" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maz/6a80376c67ff1.png" width="88"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maz.some.pics"&gt;@maz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 09:54:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a7ef22678d6f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;🏃🏻 加油！在法国的最后一圈啦。🇫🇷&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="🏃🏻 Hopsa! Laatste rondje hier in Frankrijk. 🇫🇷 " height="1486" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6a7ef22678d6f.jpg" width="1179"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 06:12:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a8001fd3559d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;喷气式飞机仍在那里。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Grounded MD-11 jets at the UPS facility in Louisville, KY." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/adam/6a8001fd3559d.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://adam.some.pics"&gt;@adam&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 06:12:37 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>